Data in this directory produced by this project (data/resolved/, data/taggs/) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Upstream inputs keep their own terms:
- data/taggs/: derived from the HHS TAGGS "Grants Terminated" PDF (U.S. Government work).
- data/grantwitness/: fetched at run time from Grant Witness (https://grantwitness.org)
  and not committed here. The site states no license, but the team's archive repo
  (https://github.com/signaltrack/gw-data) declares the data CC0-1.0 in its Zenodo
  metadata. data/resolved/ carries a handful of their columns per row under that
  understanding; each output records the upstream release tag and SHA-256 it came from.
- USAspending.gov and IRS Exempt Organizations Business Master File: U.S. Government works.
